<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Philippi-te</book>
  <para style="h">Philippi-te</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philippi-te</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philippi-te</para>
  <para style="mt">Philippi-te</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khris Jesu’ nasemte ahi Paul le Timothy in, Philippi khuo-a om Khris Jesu sunga misiengthote zosie a kipan hlattuom pawlpi makaite le upate tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa uh Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung panin kilemna le hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note kang phaw sielin ka Pasien tungah lungdamna ka ko a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka thungetna cintengah note adingin a tawntungin kipahna tawh thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kipat cil lai-a kipan tu ni dong ciengin lungdamna thu sungah nang kihal ziehun ka lung a dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note lahah nasep hoi a pan pa in Jesu Khris’ ni cieng dongin bawl muolsuoh ding hi, ci-in ka muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lungsim sung vuah nei vei ziehun note zosie tam bang dan a kang ngaisut ding pen kei adingin a man ahi hi, azieh pen ka thongkiehna, lungdamna thu ka hunna le ka kipsahna ah keima tawh kibangin note zosie in zong Pasien’ hepina na tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Khris’ ei lungsietna tawh note zosie kang ngai ngetngut lam pen Pasien ka teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thungetna ahile, note’ itna in theina le thu khentel theina bukim tawh dimlet semsem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />sil hoi pen bang ahei, ci thu khentel thei-in, Khris’ ni ciengin siengtho-in kawbanna om loin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien’ minthan nading le ama’ min a kiphat nadingin Jesu Khris tungtawna ang pei dihna’ gate tawh na kidim nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kang itte aw, kei tunga a pieng thute in lungdamna thu a kizel nadingin a panpi tahpi zo hi, ci thu note in na thei ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpi inncing galkapte le midangte zosie in Khris adinga ka thongkiehna thu a thei sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thongkiehna ziehin sanggam a tamzawte in Topa muonna-in a nei vua, zau lo tah le hangsanna lienpi tawh thu a gen ngam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in hazatna le demna tawh Khris’ thu a gen vua, ahi vangin adangte in lungsim hoi tawh a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bang mite in kei pen lungdamna thu a hung dinga tam sunga ei kikoi ahi lam a thei ziehun itna tawh Khris’ thu a gen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />adangte in lungsimtahpi tawh hi loin, ka thongkiehna-a ka gim thuohte a kibelap thei nading bepin angsung khuolna tawh Khris’ thu a gen zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile bang phamaw ahei? Ngimna zuou tawh ahi a, ngimna man tawh ahi zongin banglam banglam hi tase le Khris’ thu a kigen zo lang kalsie tuami thu-ah ka kipah mama lel hi. Hi hi, ka kipah suoh lai ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />azieh pen keima in note’ ei thungetpiehna le Jesu Khris Hlagau’ ei panpina tungtawnin tami thu in ka suotahna piengsah ding hi, ci thu ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sina tawh ahi a, hinna tawh ahi a, lam khatpopo-ah ahi zongin keima in muolphona thuoh loin, hangsanna kici zosie tawh thu ka genna ziehin ka pumpi tahsa tungah tu le a tawntungin Khris a kipatawi thei nading pen ka lunggul luot thu le ka kinepna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei dingin ahile hinna pen Khris ading ahi a, sina zong khu metna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tahsa tawh a nungta lai ding hi leng kei adingin ka nasep lawcing mama ding ahi ziehin si ding le hin ding pen teel zawh ding ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tami thu nite kikalah teel zawh kuom ding mel thei loin tangciehin ka om hi: ka lunggul pen ahile peikhie dawhin Khris tawh ka omton nuom hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua pen nahpi tahin hoizaw tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin tahsa pumpi-a ka nuntah ding pen note adingin kisamzaw tham lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami thu ka theitel lang kalsie na khanto nading ule upna sunga na lungdam nadingun note zosie tawh ka opton suoh lai ding ka thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuaci’n na kung vua kang hawkia ciengin Khris Jesu sungah na kisahtheina uh ahi keima in zong kicingtahin note kang kisahtheipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khris lungdamna thu tawh kituoh kilawmin na hinkhuo uh hing mang phot un, tua hile kei hing haw-in note tawh kimu-in ahi a, ka op lo kalin na thu uh ka galzah ahi zongin, hlagau khat sunga na dinkipna ule lungdamna thu tawh kipawl upna adingin lungsim kikhatin na hanciemna uh ka thei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />No ang langpangte ziehin zong zau vawt sih un. Tam pen amate adingin a kisietna uh a talang thu khat ahi a, hizongle tua pen note’ kihutdamna ahi zaw hi. Tam pen Pasien’ nasepna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in Khris na up nading beh uh hi loin, ama adinga na thuoh thei nading uh hamphatna zong hepina tawh note tungah ang pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka thuohsa bangin note in zong na thuoh lam uh na thei lang kalsie uh tu-in thuoh ding a nei lai ka hi lam zong thei ta un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Khris sungah kihansuona, itna tawh kihenepna, hlagau sunga kipawl theina, kilainatna le kilungsietna khatpo a op leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />lungsim kibang kuo-in, itna kibang nei a, lungsim kihuolin kithutuoh unlen, ka lungnopna kicingsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huoihamna le kihisahna tawh bangma sem loin, kiniemkhiehin noma sangin midangte a hoizaw-in ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noma’ phattuomna ding beh ngaisun loin, midangte’ phattuomna ding zong ngaisutpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khris Jesu sunga a om tami lungsim, note sungah zong omsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ pienzie nei napi, Pasien tawh kizakim ding a tu tentun sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama le ama kihawmsuohsah tawmin, sila lim la-in mihing bangin ang piengzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihing mel hing puo a, ama le ama kiniemkhieh tawmin, a sina tanpha-in thu mangin, singlamte tung nangawnah sina a thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien in ama thupi tahin tawisang a, min zosiete sangin a thupizaw min a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n vantung, leitung le lei nei-a om zosiete in Jesu’ minin a khupdin ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa Pasien’ minthan nadingin leii zosie in Jesu Khris khu Topa ahi hi, ci-in a pulah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka itte aw, note in ka thu nei man zingsa ma bangun, ka op sung beh hi loin, tu ka op lo sungin zong ei mangzaw kan lai unlen, zauna le linna lungsim tawh na hutdamna uh na cingtahsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ lungkimna banga na sep nop nading ule na sep thei nadingun note sunga na ang sem pa, Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phun lo niel loin sil bangkim sem un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua hile lungsim kawi le a letat khang mite laizangah mukawh om lo, nuol bei le khielna a nei lo Pasien’ tate na suoh ding vua, leitungah aasi bangin na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinna thu na tuhkip ziehun Khris’ ni ang tun ciengin kei pen a mawh tai le a mawh sep ka suo lona thu ka kisiel thei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin na upna ziehun silpieh ding le biehpiehna-a gaw dingin ei kisungsuh nanle note zosie tawh lungdamin ka kipah veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ma bangin note zong kipahin keima tawh a lungdamton ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note’ thu ka zahna ziehin keima zong ka lungnop tuom nadingin a sawt loin na kung vuah Timothy kang sawl ding hi, ci-in Topa sungah ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note’ phattuom nadinga ang lunghimawpi tahtah ding ama bang koima dang ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un Jesu Khris’ phattuom nading sui loin amau’ phattuom nading a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hizongle tapa in a pa tawh na a septon bangin, ama in lungdamna thu nasepna-ah keima tawh na semton zo a, note in zong Timothy’ manphatna na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka vai ding a kitel zaw lien ciengin ama ang sawl pai dingin ka kilamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima zong a sawt loin ang haw thei dingin Topa tungah muonna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka sanggampa, ka naseppi le ka galkappi pa, ka kitasapna ei seppieh, na kamtai pa Epaphroditus zong na kung vuah sawl ding kisam hi, ci-in ka ngaisun lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in note zosie ang ngai ngetngut a, note in a dam lona thu na zah ziehun ama zong a lunghel mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama pen a cina tahpi hi a, zong a si dihtah phiel ahi hi. Hizongle Pasien in ama hepi a, ama beh hi loin kei zong ei hepi hi. Tua hi sihle ka dana a kibelap to sawnsawn ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin note in ama na mukia ciengun na lungdam thei nading ule ka lunghimawna a kiem tuom nadingin ama kang peisah ding ka kin semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Topa sungah lungdam tahin ama na sang unlen, tam bang mite na patawi bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama pen Khris’ nasepna dingin note in nei seppieh thei lo uh nasepnate a sem dinga a hinna khamin a silaw dihtah vawt pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tawpna-ah ka sanggamte aw, Topa sungah lungdam un. Note tungah a kibang ma gielkia ding pen gimhuoi ka sa sih a, tua khu note adingin kihumbitna a suoh zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uite na pel un, gilo nasemte na pel unlen tahsa atkeh gawpte na pel un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite pen cilesa a suong lo, Pasien’ hlagau tawh biehna a pie, Khris Jesu sunga a kisiel le teptanna a man a zangte i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle ke’n zong cilesa sungah suon ding thu ka nei veve hi. Midang khatpo in cilesa sungah suon ding nei-a a kingaisut leh ke’n ka nei zaw kan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni giet ni-in ka tep ei kitan a, Israel’ mi, Benjamin suon, Hebrew-te pana a pieng Hebrew mi, thukham lamah zong Pharisee mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />pawnthawna lamah cilei hlattuom pawlpi a bawlsie pa, thukham tawh kisai dihna lamah zong gen a baang lo pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle ka nei hamphatna kici poma, Khris ziehin supna-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua tham loin, sil bangkim sanga a manphazaw ka Topa Jesu Khris’ thu ka theina ziehin sil bangkim supna-in ka ngaisun hi. Ama ziehin sil bangkim ka tanlaw a, tuate buathah lomtang bangin ka ngaisun hi. Tua khu Khris ka nga thei nading le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama sungah ei kimu thei nading ahi a, thukham pana ang pei keima’ dihna a nei ka hi sih a, Khris upna tungtawnin Pasien pana ang pei upna bulphu dihna a nei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in Khris le a thawkia vanglietna le, ama’ sina sungah ama bang hina tawh ama’ thuohnate thuohpi theina thu ka thei nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua pen lampi khatpopo tawh misite lah panin thawkiana ka nga thei khah leh a ci ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami ka nga zo ta a, ka mungtup ka tung zo ta hi, a ci ka hi sih a, hizongle Khris in ama’ neisa banga ei bawl ziehin keima in zong tua pen keima-a’ ka hisah thei nadingin mai ka nawt tentun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka Itte aw, tuate a nei zo-in ka kingaisun nai sih hi; hizongle ka sil bawl khat pen tami ahi hi: Nua lam thute mangngil bawlin mai lama om nate hanciemin ka del tentun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khris Jesu sungah vantung pana Pasien’ hlatna ahi patawina ka nga thei nadingin ka mungtup lam ka manaw vevaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin a picingsa eite in tam bang lungsim nei ciet vai; thu khatpo ziehin lungsim dang na nei uleh Pasien in tua thu zong ang teltheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I ngasa uh thu beh tukip ciet bo vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, keima ei ette unlen, kote tung pana na nga uh gamtat zie tawh kituohin a nungta mite ciemte un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Khris singlamte’ galte bangin mi tampi a nungta uhi; amau’ thu tamveipi kang gen ngai ta a, tu-in zong hlitui nangawn tawh kang genkia lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau’ lam tawpna pen kisietna ahi hi; a pasien uh zong gilpi ahi hi; maizum nadingte-ah a kisiel zawsop vua, leitung nate beh ngaisutin a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gammi i hina uh pen vantung ahi zaw a, tua panin Topa Jesu Khris Gumpa khat ang pei ding lawptahin i ngah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in sil bangkim ama’ khut nei-a a koisah vanglietna tawh a gina lo i pumpi pen a minthang ama’ pumpi tawh a kibang dingin ei khelpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka sanggamte, kang it kang hlenla ka kipahna, le ka kumpi lukhute ahi ka itte aw, Topa sungah na dingkip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sungah Euodia le Syntyche-te a kilungtuo nadingun ka thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi hi, a muonhuoi ka guolpa aw, tami numeite gel na panpi nadingin zong kang thum hi, bangzieh ahei cile Clement le hinna laibu sunga a min kikhumsa adang ka naseppite tawh lungdamna thu tangko nasepna ah ka panga a ding nasep hanciem mamate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa sungah lungdam tawntung un; khatvei kang cikia-in, Lungdam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi zosie kungah na lungnemna uh theisah un. Topa ang nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangma thu-ah lunghimaw seng sih unlen, sil bangkimah thungetna le thumna tawh nuomthu tut kawmin na ngette uh Pasien theisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hile mihing’ theina in a bat zawh lo Pasien’ lungnopna in Khris Jesu sungah na lungtang ule na lungsimte uh ang kemcing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tawpna-ah kang itte aw, a man poma, a patawihuoi poma, thutang poma, a siengtho poma, a deihuoi poma, a phathuoi poma, a hoipen le a phattah pen khat poma a op leh tami thute ngaisutin na nei bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima sunga na sinsa uh, na ngasa ule na zahsa uh thute bawl den pai un, tua hile kilemna Pasien in note ang ompi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in a tawpna-ah nei deisahna uh nang thasuosah ziehun Topa sungah nahpitahin ka lung a dam hi; kei adingin nei deisah tahpi vua, ahi vangin nei lah nading uh hunlem na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tasap zieha guitam ka hi vawt sih hi; bangzieh ahei cile kei pen ka nei popo tawh a lungkim dinga a kisinsa ka hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tasap kici bang hi a, kiningcing kici bang ahei ci ka thei hi. Bang khatpo le opdan cintengah gilkielna le gilvana, hauna le zawnna’ thusimte zong ka sin zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima ei thahatsah pa ahi ama tungtawnin sil bangkim ka bawl thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu khatpopo ah ka hamsatna nei thuohpi ziehun ka lung a dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />No Philippi-te in lungdamna thu ang kipat cil, Macedonia gam nuasie-a ka zin lai-in piehna le ngana lamah nomate longal ei panpi hlattuom pawlpi khat beh a op lo lam na thei uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Thessalonica khuo-a ka op sung nangawnin zong ka sapna-a zah dingin panpina khatvei sanga a tamzaw nei hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Letsong sui ka hi sih a, note’ sumkholna sazien sungah a met a na kikhol nading a sui ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nga ding za a kimin ka nga zo ta a, a kicing ding za sangin zong a tamzaw ka nei ta hi; Epaphroditus tung pana nei hlah uh letsong zong tu-in ka na nga a, ka kicing mama ta mai hi, tuate pen ahile Pasien a lungkimsah a santah biehpiehna le a namtui silpiehte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khris Jesu sungah a minthang ama’ hauna tawh kizui-in ka Pasien in na kisapna zosie uh a kimin ang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I Pasien le i Pa tungah a tawntungin minthanna omden taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khris Jesu sunga om misiengtho zosie ei na noset pieh un. Keima tawh a omton lawmte in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Misiengthote zosie, a diehdiehin kumpi innkuonte in ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina in na hlagau uh hing ompi taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
